    "description": "Initialize a Karpathy-style LLM wiki on macOS. Markdown knowledge base that LLMs read as context, scaffolded with Obsidian + Quartz. Use when the user is on macOS and wants to set up a new personal/team wiki for LLM collaboration. For Linux see llm-wiki-init-linux; for Windows see llm-wiki-init-windows.",
