    "description": "Initialize a Karpathy-style LLM wiki on Windows. Markdown knowledge base that LLMs read as context, scaffolded with Obsidian + Quartz. Use when the user is on Windows (10/11) and wants to set up a new personal/team wiki for LLM collaboration. Strongly recommends WSL2; native PowerShell path also documented. For macOS see llm-wiki-init-macos; for Linux see llm-wiki-init-linux.",
