    "description": "Isolated post-coding code reviewer. Runs on a diff/branch in a fresh context so the author's rationalization doesn't anchor the review. Reviews against the Google engineering-practices checklist plus a language design-canon module, reports findings as Conventional Comments split into blocking / non-blocking, ends with an approve / changes-needed verdict. Use as the review gate after a non-trivial code change, before declaring work done.",
